Manual scan:
  - REQUIRE_SIGNED default OFF — backward compat with v1.0
    customers whose FileServer still serves plain .json. ✓
  - signed-manifest payload field whitelist preserves only fields
    the signer commits to; downstream gets defaults for missing
    `min`/`channel`. No way for a signed manifest to inject extra
    keys that escape cmpSemver semantics.
  - canonicalize() identical byte-for-byte in updater/manifest-verify.ts
    and scripts/sign-manifest.ts — verified by re-reading both.
  - signer refuses overwrite without --force, validates required
    payload fields before signing (latest/imageRepo/imageTag).
  - hex parsing rejects odd-length / non-hex; pubkey length
    enforced (64 chars).

